WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:21.012
After Cooking class Ben met Waldo and his other friends in the hallway to discuss Winnie's surprise party.

2
00:00:21.032 --> 00:00:25.115
"Mog and I will handle the decorations," Deb said.

3
00:00:26.075 --> 00:00:26.996
Mog grinned.

4
00:00:27.768 --> 00:00:30.770
"Wait until you see what Deb can do with spider webs.

5
00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:32.611
She's a true artist!"

6
00:00:32.631 --> 00:00:38.034
"I'm going to make a batch of newt punch," a witch said.

7
00:00:38.054 --> 00:00:40.055
"It's Winnie's favorite."

8
00:00:41.476 --> 00:00:43.297
Ben didn't say much during the meeting.

9
00:00:45.058 --> 00:00:50.341
His mind was on his two problems—the cooking competition and Winnie's birthday gift.

10
00:00:53.643 --> 00:00:57.472
When everyone headed back to class, he grabbed Waldo.

11
00:00:57.492 --> 00:00:59.393
"I need your help."

12
00:00:59.413 --> 00:01:01.333
"What's wrong?"

13
00:01:01.674 --> 00:01:02.534
Waldo asked.

14
00:01:03.234 --> 00:01:04.414
Ben leaned in closer.

15
00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:08.355
"I don't want to be on Kids' Kitchen Showdown."

16
00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:10.876
"Are you kidding?"

17
00:01:11.496 --> 00:01:13.637
Waldo's glasses slid down his nose.

18
00:01:16.438 --> 00:01:19.178
"Most monsters would love to be on that show!"

19
00:01:19.198 --> 00:01:20.919
"Not me."

20
00:01:22.739 --> 00:01:24.540
Waldo scratched the side of his head.

21
00:01:26.472 --> 00:01:27.753
"I'll come up with some ideas.

22
00:01:28.373 --> 00:01:30.294
Meet me in the cooking classroom after school."

23
00:01:32.776 --> 00:01:35.637
Ben hardly heard anything in history class that morning.

24
00:01:36.418 --> 00:01:36.878
As Mrs.

25
00:01:36.978 --> 00:01:43.462
Flump droned on about the Monster Stamp Act of 1839, Ben thought about Kids' Kitchen Showdown.

26
00:01:44.042 --> 00:01:46.063
He couldn't wait to hear Waldo's ideas.

27
00:01:48.425 --> 00:01:52.387
The wizard's spells usually went wrong, but Ben was getting desperate.

28
00:01:53.347 --> 00:01:56.502
Besides, maybe Waldo wouldn't even have to use magic.

29
00:01:56.522 --> 00:01:58.683
"Soon I'll be free!"

30
00:01:59.003 --> 00:02:00.124
Ben thought gleefully.

31
00:02:01.045 --> 00:02:02.145
Winnie sat nearby.

32
00:02:02.165 --> 00:02:03.947
"What are you smiling about?"

33
00:02:04.407 --> 00:02:05.107
she whispered.

34
00:02:05.127 --> 00:02:08.950
"Huh?" Ben hadn't realized he'd been smiling.

35
00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:10.391
"Oh, nothing."

36
00:02:11.652 --> 00:02:13.493
Winnie gave him a suspicious look.

37
00:02:17.235 --> 00:02:20.818
"You must be thinking about the perfect birthday present you got for me."

38
00:02:20.838 --> 00:02:23.019
"What present?"

39
00:02:23.359 --> 00:02:23.880
Ben said.

40
00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:29.583
"I didn't get you—I mean "Relax," Winnie teased him.

41
00:02:29.603 --> 00:02:30.964
"I'm just kidding."

42
00:02:36.407 --> 00:02:41.009
After school Ben rushed into the cooking classroom and found Waldo waiting for him.

43
00:02:41.029 --> 00:02:44.591
"Did you think of anything?"

44
00:02:44.911 --> 00:02:45.612
Ben asked.

45
00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:47.312
"I sure did!"

46
00:02:48.273 --> 00:02:49.053
Waldo beamed.

47
00:02:49.073 --> 00:02:51.115
"Hot sauce!"

48
00:02:53.316 --> 00:02:54.800
"Huh? Hot sauce?"

49
00:02:55.881 --> 00:02:58.282
"Not just any hot sauce," Waldo said.

50
00:02:58.302 --> 00:03:00.223
"Monster hot sauce.

51
00:03:01.664 --> 00:03:03.825
Your food will be so spicy, Mr.

52
00:03:03.986 --> 00:03:05.106
Icky will get nervous.

53
00:03:05.767 --> 00:03:09.989
He'll decide that it's much too hot for the humans and pull you from the competition."

54
00:03:13.971 --> 00:03:15.012
Ben said slowly.

55
00:03:15.032 --> 00:03:18.954
"I guess that might work."

56
00:03:18.994 --> 00:03:22.516
"Mr. Icky is gone for the day—let's make some hot sauce right now!"

57
00:03:25.201 --> 00:03:30.084
While Waldo searched the pantry for spicy ingredients, Ben set a pot on the stove.

58
00:03:32.006 --> 00:03:35.288
He was chopping slugs when Waldo came back from the pantry.

59
00:03:36.509 --> 00:03:39.631
The wizard placed a bunch of jars and bottles on the counter.

60
00:03:41.192 --> 00:03:42.914
Most of the labels showed flames.

61
00:03:43.474 --> 00:03:45.655
A couple had skulls and crossbones.

62
00:03:47.637 --> 00:03:48.898
Waldo unscrewed a cap.

63
00:03:49.478 --> 00:03:51.720
A wisp of smoke drifted from the bottle.

64
00:03:53.984 --> 00:03:58.605
"This is concentrated volcano smoke," he said, pouring it into the pot.

65
00:03:59.986 --> 00:04:03.067
Poof! A cloud of smoke billowed from the pot.

66
00:04:04.147 --> 00:04:05.967
The sauce bubbled violently.

67
00:04:07.148 --> 00:04:09.628
Ben and Waldo looked at each other and smiled.

68
00:04:10.429 --> 00:04:13.210
Waldo picked up another bottle and examined the label.

69
00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.230
"I'm not sure what this is.

70
00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:16.971
It's in another language.

71
00:04:17.371 --> 00:04:18.851
But it does show flames."

72
00:04:20.812 --> 00:04:21.492
He poured it in.

73
00:04:24.068 --> 00:04:26.470
Bubbles formed on the surface of the hot sauce.

74
00:04:27.631 --> 00:04:30.393
They popped, sending orange vapors into the air.

75
00:04:32.115 --> 00:04:34.597
Ben dipped a spoon into the sauce and tasted it.

76
00:04:36.018 --> 00:04:37.479
His hair stood straight up.

77
00:04:37.499 --> 00:04:39.341
"Whoa!" he cried.

78
00:04:41.022 --> 00:04:42.023
Waldo tasted it.

79
00:04:42.703 --> 00:04:43.764
His hair stood up too.

80
00:04:43.784 --> 00:04:46.627
"Do you think it's done?"

81
00:04:47.007 --> 00:04:47.747
Ben asked.

82
00:04:47.767 --> 00:04:51.210
"Nah." Waldo pushed his glasses up.

83
00:04:51.751 --> 00:04:53.072
"We're just getting started!"

84
00:04:55.584 --> 00:04:59.647
He popped open a small jar and sprinkled in some small red crystals.

85
00:05:00.467 --> 00:05:03.549
Fwoomf! A giant flame leaped from the pot.

86
00:05:04.009 --> 00:05:05.690
Ben and Waldo jumped backward.

87
00:05:06.331 --> 00:05:09.593
When the flame went down, Ben dipped his spoon into the pot.

88
00:05:09.613 --> 00:05:13.775
"Yikes! My spoon melted!"

89
00:05:13.795 --> 00:05:16.357
"The recipe is working."

90
00:05:18.878 --> 00:05:21.420
Waldo emptied a few more bottles into the pot.

91
00:05:23.636 --> 00:05:25.258
Then he opened a large jar.

92
00:05:25.278 --> 00:05:27.700
"What's that?"

93
00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:28.781
Ben asked.

94
00:05:28.801 --> 00:05:31.403
"It's pure lava."

95
00:05:32.284 --> 00:05:34.486
Waldo measured out two cups of the lava.

96
00:05:42.213 --> 00:05:47.177
Red steam filled the air, fogging up Waldo's glasses.

97
00:05:47.918 --> 00:05:50.000
He took them off and placed them on the counter.

98
00:05:51.336 --> 00:05:54.478
Waldo and Ben let the hot sauce simmer for a few minutes.

99
00:05:55.498 --> 00:05:57.900
Then Waldo leaned over and sniffed.

100
00:06:00.101 --> 00:06:04.503
Instantly his nose turned bright red and his eyes began to water.

101
00:06:07.645 --> 00:06:08.465
"Let me taste it."

102
00:06:10.106 --> 00:06:12.167
Ben skimmed the surface with his spoon.

103
00:06:13.128 --> 00:06:15.069
He brought it to his lips and took a sip.

104
00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.731
He felt a rush of heat flow through his body.

105
00:06:19.971 --> 00:06:23.026
Looking down, he saw that he'd turned completely red!

106
00:06:23.046 --> 00:06:25.187
"Wow!" he said.

107
00:06:25.207 --> 00:06:27.889
"Waldo, I think the sauce is done!"

108
00:06:27.909 --> 00:06:31.352
"I have one more thing to add."

109
00:06:32.313 --> 00:06:35.936
Waldo ran to the pantry and came back with another small jar.

110
00:06:35.956 --> 00:06:39.278
"I'm going to put in a teaspoon of this stuff.

111
00:06:39.819 --> 00:06:41.340
It's called enhancer.

112
00:06:42.161 --> 00:06:43.562
It'll enhance all the flavors."

113
00:06:45.263 --> 00:06:51.557
He unscrewed the lid, scooped out some enhancer, and dropped it into the hot sauce.

114
00:06:52.759 --> 00:06:55.943
The pot began to shake as the sauce bubbled fiercely.

115
00:06:56.745 --> 00:06:59.589
Ben gasped as hot sauce erupted from the pot!
